{
    "title": "Color Analysis - Dressika",
    "description": "Color analysis and personal style AI consultant app that uses the 12 seasons theory to help you find your best colors and create perfect outfits. With the automatic personal color analysis feature, simply take a selfie to discover your season color, seasonal color palette, and makeup colors that harmonize with your skin tone, eyes, and hair color.\r\n<h3><b>\ud83c\udfa8 Color Analysis (aka Seasonal Color Analysis or Personal Color Analysis):</b></h3>\r\n\u2606 Use the automatic seasonal color analysis or take the professional's manual quiz to determine one of the 12 season colors: light summer, soft summer, cold summer, deep autumn, warm autumn, soft autumn, light spring, bright spring, warm spring, deep winter, bright winter, cold winter.\r\n\u2606 Discover your personal color palettes to make great individual looks and enhance your natural beauty. Use colorimetria & armocromia to find your style dna.\r\n<h3><b>\ud83d\udc57 Virtual Wardrobe:</b></h3>\r\n\u2606 Store your looks in a virtual wardrobe and combine clothes to create a perfect outfit that matches your seasonal color palettes.\r\n\u2606 Get style inspiration from the latest fashion trends and share your style with friends.\r\n<h3><b>\ud83d\udc5a Virtual Fitting Room:</b></h3>\r\n\u2606 Try on looks from online stores before making a purchase and select an outfit that fits your seasonal color analysis and makeup palette.\r\n\u2606 Experiment with different styles and accessories to create the perfect look.\r\n<h3><b>\ud83c\udfa8 Personal Color Palette:</b></h3>\r\n\u2606 Combine 120 colors to create stylish, trendy, and fashionable looks that match your season.\r\n\u2606 Add my best colors to the color palette using a wheel, mix & match looks and accessories using an additional color palette with combinations.\r\n<h3><b>\ud83d\udc84 Makeup Palettes:</b></h3>\r\n\u2606 Explore 170 makeup colors, including lipsticks, eyeshadows, eyeliners, and blushes, for each color type.\r\n\u2606 Apply virtual makeovers to see your entire look and find the perfect makeup to complement your seasonal colors.\r\n<h3><b>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83e\uddb0 Hair Color Changer:</b></h3>\r\n\u2606 Experiment with 180 hair colors and find the perfect hair color that matches your seasonal color palette.\r\n\r\nWith Dressika, you can create a capsule wardrobe like a stylist, follow fashion trends, and make great individual looks using seasonal color analysis. Try Dressika now and discover your unique style dna!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Color analysis and personal style AI consultant app that uses the 12 seasons theory to help you find your best colors and create perfect outfits. With the automatic personal color analysis feature, simply take a selfie to discover your season color, seasonal color palette, and makeup colors that harmonize with your skin tone, eyes, and hair color.<br><h3><b>\ud83c\udfa8 Color Analysis (aka Seasonal Color Analysis or Personal Color Analysis):</b></h3><br>\u2606 Use the automatic seasonal color analysis or take the professional&#39;s manual quiz to determine one of the 12 season colors: light summer, soft summer, cold summer, deep autumn, warm autumn, soft autumn, light spring, bright spring, warm spring, deep winter, bright winter, cold winter.<br>\u2606 Discover your personal color palettes to make great individual looks and enhance your natural beauty. Use colorimetria &amp; armocromia to find your style dna.<br><h3><b>\ud83d\udc57 Virtual Wardrobe:</b></h3><br>\u2606 Store your looks in a virtual wardrobe and combine clothes to create a perfect outfit that matches your seasonal color palettes.<br>\u2606 Get style inspiration from the latest fashion trends and share your style with friends.<br><h3><b>\ud83d\udc5a Virtual Fitting Room:</b></h3><br>\u2606 Try on looks from online stores before making a purchase and select an outfit that fits your seasonal color analysis and makeup palette.<br>\u2606 Experiment with different styles and accessories to create the perfect look.<br><h3><b>\ud83c\udfa8 Personal Color Palette:</b></h3><br>\u2606 Combine 120 colors to create stylish, trendy, and fashionable looks that match your season.<br>\u2606 Add my best colors to the color palette using a wheel, mix &amp; match looks and accessories using an additional color palette with combinations.<br><h3><b>\ud83d\udc84 Makeup Palettes:</b></h3><br>\u2606 Explore 170 makeup colors, including lipsticks, eyeshadows, eyeliners, and blushes, for each color type.<br>\u2606 Apply virtual makeovers to see your entire look and find the perfect makeup to complement your seasonal colors.<br><h3><b>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83e\uddb0 Hair Color Changer:</b></h3><br>\u2606 Experiment with 180 hair colors and find the perfect hair color that matches your seasonal color palette.<br><br>With Dressika, you can create a capsule wardrobe like a stylist, follow fashion trends, and make great individual looks using seasonal color analysis. Try Dressika now and discover your unique style dna!",
